      "name": "Pandion",
      "rank": "GENUS",
      "description": "One of the most cosmopolitan raptors, found on every continent except Antarctica. Adapted entirely for catching fish — reversible outer toe, spiny toe pads, closeable nostrils for diving. Sweden has one of Europe's largest osprey populations, over 4,000 pairs nesting on prominent dead snags above lakes and rivers.",
